WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.600
Stand facing a chair or wall for support.

2
00:00:01.600 --> 00:00:03.200
Widen the feet and lower into a squat.

3
00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:04.800
Keep heels on a folded blanket if they lift.

4
00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:06.400
Hands on support; belly soft.

5
00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:08.000
Rise slowly.
